    {
      "id": "claim_e55f0c86f6ca483db5e5281e859fad0e",
      "statement": "The regulatory SCB is derived from the Fed's supervisory stress test as peak-to-trough CET1 decline plus four quarters of planned dividends. The 2025 CCAR cycle gave 3.2%, effective 2025-10-01 to 2026-09-30, and a preliminary 2026 SCB received 2026-06-27 is expected to stay at 3.2% from 2026-10-01.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/reports/mhfc-2025-annual-report.md#L305-L305",
