    {
      "id": "claim_cf25544d4d5c4adaa2ceaba914a064e1",
      "statement": "The stress projection suspends buybacks, holds dividends flat, recognizes tax benefits on losses at the 22% effective rate, takes PPNR, provisions and trading/counterparty losses as top-down inputs from the enterprise stress testing program, and uses scenario-specific RWA growth (rising early, then falling), so the trough ratio of 12.90% occurs in Q3 2027.",
