    {
      "id": "claim_73a7617671c546fbbac77c9ae6d9746d",
      "statement": "The model is simplified: it has no AOCI volatility modelling and no deferred-tax-asset threshold deductions, and stress losses are not derived in the workbook. It is a Tier 1 (High) model owned by Corporate Treasury - Capital Management, validated by MRGR (last 2026-02-27, next due 2027-02-28), and re-run each quarter.",
