      "id": "claim_2062c99cb7b7478880fbf6be30bd3a87",
      "statement": "Under the Standardized approach the capital conservation buffer requirement equals SCB plus G-SIB surcharge plus countercyclical buffer (5.7%). The firm held 10.58% at 2025-12-31 and faced no limits on distributions.",
