    {
      "id": "claim_d45d6a42921542868366f52feb90349e",
      "statement": "In the 2025 CCAR cycle the Fed's projected minimum CET1 under the supervisory severely adverse scenario was 12.1%, against the firm's own 12.6% from MDL-CAP-003. The risk appetite sets an internal severely adverse minimum of 10.2% or more, with 12.6% at 2025-12-31.",
